rule.membership_discount_order	rule	membership_discount_order	样例业务先计算活动折扣，再对活动后单价计算会员折扣。order_items.membership_discount_amount 已保存实际会员让利，unit_price 已同时扣除活动和会员优惠；不要从支付金额再次扣减。	{会员折扣顺序,折上折,会员优惠计算}	{membership_tiers,order_items}	catalog-v2	8beef3cee8b9cecbc3559b9d3cd152b7fa097bcc2b080c36ddb9093cf0d4ed0f	qwen3.7-text-embedding	[0.017680602,0.06390947,0.027633091,0.011909938,-0.0064633978,0.010016043,-0.06146901,0.022917416,-0.02707382,-0.01888812,-0.0441316,0.029717648,-0.06660414,0.010391008,-0.06268924,-0.021404842,0.023743613,-0.023641927,0.036200114,0.048300713,-0.057096526,-0.009488548,0.004356597,0.007772601,0.02618407,0.042809684,-0.0016746365,0.005491028,0.04136066,-0.013613175,0.05577461,-0.04059802,0.012672582,-0.031471726,0.014985931,0.058621813,0.052418984,-0.0037750818,-0.009558457,0.010378297,-0.0016166439,0.016422242,0.06304514,0.01282511,-0.024722338,0.003883123,0.003387405,-0.00907545,0.026285756,-0.00082381314,0.028624527,0.010530827,0.029488856,0.025510402,0.02938717,-0.005405231,-0.02172261,-0.045377247,-0.00489998,-0.04080139,0.0036225533,-0.0069400496,-0.0051637273,0.018316139,-0.017591627,0.012882308,-0.03647975,-0.035412047,-0.025726484,0.02440457,-0.056384724,0.01600279,-0.05536787,0.036937334,0.019536367,0.0076264283,0.008770392,0.005535516,-0.0003320674,0.00069392554,-0.009571168,-0.026667077,-0.0029202865,-0.017184885,-0.024989262,0.03653059,0.028039834,-0.023349581,0.010511761,-0.029844755,-0.051249597,0.014935088,-0.00094933144,-0.03396303,0.032336056,0.0034255374,-0.010295678,-0.020400696,-0.029895598,0.064163685,0.008776748,-0.012945862,0.009539391,-0.00784251,0.026845027,0.031776782,-0.0026899048,-0.034801934,0.02477318,0.015379963,-0.016892537,-0.008630575,-0.0073658586,-0.0052399915,-0.0009231156,-0.02798899,-0.009888935,-0.015367253,0.0085416,0.0070480905,0.022281881,0.038411777,0.06279092,-0.010200348,0.008846656,0.038233828,-0.018811855,-0.020349853,-0.05419848,-0.0010081185,0.025853591,-0.016104475,-0.0072196852,-0.022383567,0.02643