table.order_promotions	table	analytics.order_promotions	订单与活动的桥接表。allocated_discount_amount 是活动在订单上的分摊优惠额。一张订单理论上可关联多个活动，因此连接后计算订单数要 COUNT(DISTINCT order_id)，计算支付金额前应先按订单聚合。\n当前数据库字段：order_id integer; campaign_id integer; allocated_discount_amount numeric	{订单活动,活动订单,促销分摊,活动优惠}	{order_promotions,orders,campaigns}	catalog-v2	a6ea11c0f36bf0cdcb2556abebdaff5ceca1ff5263d649fde1496235c6dbeb5d	qwen3.7-text-embedding	[0.023040874,0.030007305,0.033610195,-0.0106512075,-0.032703176,0.015923271,-0.089392036,-0.028016895,-0.026706753,-0.02168034,-0.016767306,0.03350942,-0.042932365,0.0012463676,-0.03164498,-0.02372114,0.006582207,-0.020042662,0.06399543,0.05119634,-0.044696018,-0.042881977,-0.002840742,-0.0064877253,0.020647343,0.018757714,0.010311075,-0.015961064,0.030813547,-0.018090045,0.057646275,-0.020584356,0.00092355604,-0.04560304,-0.01521781,0.0875276,0.07467813,-0.011192901,-0.030863937,0.008138001,0.018430179,-0.004270561,0.071805894,0.038447645,0.0295286,-0.010481141,0.05049088,-0.044091336,-0.025585573,-0.0011597597,0.010040227,-0.0008471836,0.031141082,0.02453998,0.04131988,0.023935298,-0.034290463,-0.0295286,-0.0048091053,-0.0371627,-0.0007133348,0.006846755,-0.01283058,0.03771699,-0.02382192,0.026454803,-0.053312726,-0.024514783,-0.0033162984,0.005114595,-0.058099784,0.0005416936,-0.025384013,0.03436605,0.015545346,-0.0007271134,-0.0060499613,0.013114024,0.013403767,0.011677906,-0.00447842,-0.026505193,-0.028268846,-0.026530387,0.00040351448,0.01598626,0.027210655,-0.011967649,0.0075459173,-0.038800377,-0.061979823,-0.0029273499,-0.01567132,-0.031267058,0.044166923,0.020483576,-0.029276649,-0.03950584,0.0021148096,0.09402793,0.018039655,-0.014210008,-0.004484719,-0.014663519,-0.01613743,0.023758933,-0.018404985,-0.052657656,0.007728582,0.022436192,-0.011892064,0.024401406,-0.006846755,-0.0020266268,-0.014802092,-0.00539489,-0.009889057,-0.03527307,0.01022919,0.018090045,0.035802167,0.035953335,0.05487482,-0.005999571,0.033433832,0.0010581921,-0.04265522,-0.01708